      "content": "stretches sound okay. i was actually thinking maybe it was just from grinding my teeth at night because i've been super stressed lately. i dont really want to go to the doctor or anything if i dont have to, it's such a hassle. do u think it's safe to just take some ibuprofen and wait a few days to see if it goes away?",
